Third-party code in COAL
-----------------------

The Ka/Ks (dN/dS) engine, cpp/src/kaks.cpp and kaks.hpp (and the output format in cpp/src/kaks_cli.cpp; the
copies of kaks.cpp and kaks.hpp in packaging/r/coalr/src/coal/), is derived from two programs distributed under
the GNU General Public License, version 3. It is a modified version of their code, not an independent
implementation; the header of cpp/src/kaks.cpp says what was changed (Chloe Newton and Keanu Murati, 2026).

- KaKs_Calculator 2.0 (kakscalculator2 2.0.1, https://github.com/kullrich/kakscalculator2; original project
  https://sourceforge.net/projects/kakscalculator2/). In cpp/src/kaks.cpp: base.cpp (Fisher's exact test, the
  derived output values), NG86.cpp, LWL85.cpp, LPB93.cpp, YN00.cpp, MYN.cpp. In cpp/src/kaks_cli.cpp: KaKs.cpp
  and base.cpp (the header line, the order of the columns and the composite fields of the .kaks output).
  Copyright (C) 2009, Beijing Institute of Genomics of CAS. All rights reserved.
  Authors: Da-Peng Wang and Yu-Bin Zhang (version 2.0), Zhang Zhang (version 1.0), Kristian K Ullrich
  (modified versions 2.0.1, 2.0.2).
  Licence: GNU General Public License, version 3 (the LICENSE file of that project; the same text as COAL's).
  Wang D, Zhang Y, Zhang Z, Zhu J, Yu J (2010) Genomics Proteomics Bioinformatics 8:77-80.

- PAML 4.10 (https://github.com/abacus-gene/paml): yn00.c, "Pairwise estimation of dS and dN by the method of
  Yang & Nielsen (2000 Mol. Biol. Evol. 17:32-43)", and the routines of tools.c it uses.
  Copyright, 1998, Ziheng Yang.
  Licence: GNU General Public License, version 3 (PAML's LICENSE and README).
  Yang Z (2007) Mol Biol Evol 24:1586-1591.

Neither program is included as such; `coal kaks` and `coal dnds` do not run them. The reference outputs under
tests/kaks/golden/ were written by KaKs_Calculator 2.0.1 and PAML 4.10.10 yn00.

